    "body": "EpicCraft Launcher for Windows x64, built and verified locally.\n\nIncludes the custom release index, automatic updates enabled by default, separate launcher settings, and updates that wait for running apps to close. All twelve app sources are included in this repository.\n\nExtract the zip and run artcraft-launcher.exe inside the folder. Keep portable.txt beside it. Existing app projects and settings are preserved. Windows may request administrator permission for app MSI updates.\n\nVerified with cargo xtask ci: formatting, Clippy, workspace tests, and WebAssembly checks passed."
